# Africa Season 1 — Delivery Standards

Quantifiable targets for every episode delivered from this project. These are **hard numbers**, not style guidance — **verify against them** before marking a render or export "done" in `PRODUCTION_STATUS.md`.

Full copy: `docs/DELIVERY_STANDARDS.md`. 4K/HDR out of scope until `docs/PRE_4K_GATE.md` closes.

## Video (current SDR / non-4K)

| Parameter | Target |
|-----------|--------|
| Resolution | **1920×1080** minimum. Never upscale from a lower native render to fake this. |
| Frame rate | Match Blender project native fps **exactly** end-to-end (Blender → Resolve → export). **Do not** conform 24↔30. |
| Codec / container | H.264, High Profile, MP4, closed GOP at **half** the frame rate |
| Bitrate | **8–12 Mbps** 1080p VBR (2-pass); top of range for high-motion kinetic/stock |
| Chroma / bit depth | 4:2:0, 8-bit min (SDR) |
| Color space | Rec. 709 |

## Audio

| Parameter | Target |
|-----------|--------|
| Sample rate | **48 kHz** |
| Codec | AAC-LC |
| Bitrate | **320–384 kbps** stereo |
| Loudness | **−14 LUFS** integrated |
| True peak | **≤ −1 dBTP** |

YouTube turns down louder than −14 LUFS but does not boost quiet audio — undershooting is worse than overshooting.

## Safe margins

| Zone | Margin |
|------|--------|
| Title-safe | Center **80%** (10% all sides) |
| Action-safe | Center **90%** |
| Caption / L3 exclusion | Avoid bottom **~15%** for primary content |
| Watermark exclusion | Avoid top-right **~15%** for essentials |

## Pipeline consistency

- Canva exports: **1920×1080** exact at export — no upscale on Resolve ingest.
- One fps at Blender, Canva, Resolve timeline, and final export — confirm **before** assembly.
- Keep uncompressed/high-bitrate **master** before YouTube-spec export.

## Definition of done

Launching a job ≠ done. Before updating `PRODUCTION_STATUS.md`, verify resolution, fps, duration, file sanity, and that the file plays. Do not apply 4K bitrate/resolution numbers while the gate is open.
